    },
    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "분노 유전자",
        "summary": "나르는 전투 중 분노가 생성됩니다. 분노가 최고치에 도달하면 다음번 스킬을 사용할 때 메가 나르로 변신하여 생존력이 커지고 스킬이 바뀝니다.",
        "tooltip": "나르가 피해를 입거나 입힐 때 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">분노</span>를 생성합니다. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">분노</span>가 최고치에 도달하면 다음번 스킬을 사용할 때 15초 동안 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">메가 나르</span>로 변신합니다.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">미니 나르:</span> <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가 </span>, <span>공격 속도가 (5.5% ~ 99%)</span>, 사거리가 (0 ~ 100) 증가합니다.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">메가 나르:</span> <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">최대 체력이 </span>, <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">방어력이 (3.5 ~ 54.5)</span>, <span>마법 저항력이 (3.5 ~ 63)</span>, <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">공격력이 (6 ~ 48.5)</span> 증가합니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Rage Gene",
        "summary": "While in combat Gnar generates Rage. At maximum Rage his next ability will transform him into Mega Gnar, granting increased survivability and access to new spells.",
        "tooltip": "Gnar generates <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Rage</span> by dealing and receiving damage. At max <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Rage</span> his next Ability transforms him into <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mega Gnar</span> for 15 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mini Gnar:</span> Gain <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\"> Move Speed</span>, <span>(5.5% ~ 99%) Attack Speed</span>, and (0 ~ 100) Attack Range.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mega Gnar:</span> Gain <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"> max Health</span>, <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(3.5 ~ 54.5) Armor</span>, <span>(3.5 ~ 63) Magic Resist</span>, and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(6 ~ 48.5) Attack Damage</span>."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "狂怒基因",
        "summary": "在战斗时，纳尔会产生怒气。在怒气到达最大值时，他的下一个技能将使他变形成巨型纳尔，获得强化的生存能力并能使用新的技能。",
        "tooltip": "纳尔可通过造成和受到伤害来生成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>。在满层<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">怒气</span>时，他的下一个技能会使他变形为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">巨型纳尔</span>，持续15秒。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">小型纳尔：</span>获得<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>，<span>(5.5% ~ 99%)攻击速度</span>，以及(0 ~ 100)攻击距离。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">巨型纳尔：</span>获得<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">最大生命值</span>，<span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(3.5 ~ 54.5)护甲</span>，<span>(3.5 ~ 63)魔法抗性</span>，和<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(6 ~ 48.5)攻击力</span>。"
      }
    }
  }
